@startuml lld-us17-class
title LLD-US17 Add a beneficiary: class diagram
skinparam monochrome true
hide empty members
class BeneficiaryService <<service>> {
  + add(cust, acc, ifsc)
}
class IfscDirectory <<external>> {
  + lookup(ifsc)
}
class Beneficiary <<entity>> {
  acc, ifsc
  addedAt, cap
}
BeneficiaryService --> IfscDirectory
BeneficiaryService --> Beneficiary : creates
@enduml